  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana balume ba baprofete bakambila Elisha ne, Muaba utudi bashikame ku mpala kuebe udi mutambe kubumbakana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tudi tukusengelela ne, Witabushe bua tuetu kuya ku Yadene, muntu ne muntu baditahile mitshi, tudienzeleku muaba utudi mua kushikama. Yeye wakabambila ne, Yai bienu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukuabo wakamuambila ne, Tudi tukusengelela ne, Witabushe bua kuya ne bantu bebe. Yeye wakabambila ne, Nenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku wakaya nʼabo. Hakafikabo ku Yadene, bakataha mitshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadi mukuabo utaha mutshi, tshisui tshiakanuka, tshikahona mu mai; yeye wakadila ne, Aka, mukelenge wanyi, tshiakadi tshisomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wa Nzambi wakamuebesha ne, Tshiakahona kudi kunyi? Yeye wakamuosha muaba. Yeye wakakosa mutshi, wakawela mu mai, ne tshisui tshiakalelemuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamuambila ne, Utshiangate. Yeye wakolola tshianza tshiandi, wakatshiangata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wa Bena Sulia wakadi uluangana ne Bena Isalele; wakambila bantu bandi ne, Tshitudilu tshianyi netshikale mu muaba kampanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wa Nzambi wakatumina mukelenge wa Isalele dî ne, Udimuke, kuhitshidi ku muaba kampanda au bualu bua Bena Sulia badi bahuekelaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku mukelenge wa Isalele wakadianjila kutuma bantu ku muaba wakamuambila muntu wa Nzambi, wakatusungila nansha musangu umue nansha misangu ibidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutshima wa mukelenge wa Sulia wakatamba kunyingalala bua bualu ebu; wakabikila bantu bandi, wakabebesha ne, Kanuena bandesha ne, Nganyi wa munkatshi muetu udi ku luseke lua mukelenge wa Isalele, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umue wa bantu bandi wakamuambila ne, Mukelenge wetu, kakuena muntu; kadi Elisha, muprofete wa mu Isalele, udi wamhila mukelenge wa Isalele mei audi wamba mu nsubu webe wa bulalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Yai, nutangile kudiye, bua meme ntume bantu, balue nʼandi. Bakamba ne, Udi ku Dotana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku yeye wakafumaku tubalu ne makalu ne masalayi a bungi; bakayaku butuku, bakanyunguluka musoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakabika muena mudimu wa muntu wa Nzambi dinda dionso, wakaluhuka, wakatangila tshisumbu tshia masalayi ne tubalu ne makalu tshiakanyunguluka musoko. Muena mudimu wandi wakamuebesha ne, Aka, mukelenge wanyi, netuenze tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamuambila ne, Kutshinyi nansha; bualu bua badi nʼetu badi bahita badi nʼabo bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha wakatendelela Yehowa ne, Ndi nkusengelela ne, Utabashe mesu andi bua yeye amone. Yehowa wakatabasha mesu a nsongalume, wakamona mikuna miule tente ne tubalu ne makalu a kahia binyunguluka Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakasemena bantu aba ha buihi ne Elisha, yeye wakalomba Yehowa ne, Ndi nkusengelela ne, Ufofomeshe mesu a bantu aba. Yeye wakabafofomesha mesu ku dî dia Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha wakabambila ne, Eu kanshila nansha, kammusoko nansha; nundonde, meme nennufile kudi muntu unudi nukeba. Yeye wakabalombola ku Samalea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakabuelabo mu Samalea, Elisha wakatendelela Yehowa ne, Utabashe mesu a bantu aba bua bobo bamone. Yehowa wakatabasha mesu abo, bakamona ne, Tudi mu musoko wa Samalea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakabatangila mukelenge wa Isalele, yeye wakebesha Elisha ne, Tatu wanyi, nembashihe, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamukudimuna ne, Nansha, kubashihi; udi musue kushiha bantu bawakukuata bahika ku muele wa nvita ne ku buta, anyi? Uteke bidia ne mai ku mpala kuabo, bobo badie, banue, bahingane kudi mukelenge wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabalongoluela bintu bia bungi; hakashikishabo kudia ne kunua, yeye wakabatuma kudi mukelenge wabo. Bena Sulia kabakalua mu buloba bua Bena Isalele bua kuhaulabo kabidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nyima kua malu â Benehadada, mukelenge wa Sulia, wakasangisha masalayi andi onso, bakaya, bakatshintshimika musoko wa Samalea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshiole tshinene tshiakadi mu Samalea; bakatshintshimika musoko tô ne hakahanabo mutu wa nyama wa mpunda ku nshekele",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.25:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nshekele wa argent wakadi ne bujitu bu bua 15 gr.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ya argent makumi muanda mukulu, ne tshituha tshinai tshia bibuelelu bia nyunyu wa nkutshi ku nshekele ya argent itanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadi mukelenge wa Isalele wendakana ha mutu ha lumbu lua musoko, mukashi mukuabo wakadila kudiye ne, Mukelenge, unkuatshishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamuebesha ne, Biabenga Yehowa kukukuatshisha, ndi mua kukukuatshisha kudi kunyi? Nenkukuatshishe ne bintu bia ku tshihehudi anyi bia ku tshikaminu tshia tumuma, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakamuebesha kabidi ne. Udi ne tshilumbu kai? Mukashi wakamuambila ne, Mukashi eu wakungambila ne, Tufile muanʼebe wa balume, tumudie lelu, ne makelela netudie muanʼanyi wa balume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku tuakalamba muanʼanyi wa balume mu mai a kahia, tuakamudia; hakatshiabu, nakamuambila ne, Ufile muanʼebe wa balume, tumudie; kadi yeye wakasokoka muanʼandi wa balume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvua mukelenge mei a mukashi eu, wakadihanda bilulu biandi (yeye wakadi wendakana ha mutu ha lumbu); bantu bakamona ne, Yeye wakadi ne bilulu bikayabala mubishi mua bilulu hamʼbidi handi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakamba ne, Nzambi angenzele nunku ne malu makuabo ha mutu kabidi biashala mutu wa Elisha, muana wa Shafata, hamʼbidi handi lelu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
